---
/*
 * Canale e Activity (spec della home, §3.3): due riquadri affiancati, senza disegni, perché la scena li ha appena
 * mostrati. «New in 2.0» dice una cosa vera e utile. L'ancora #two-ways è il link del terzo punto di forza.
 */
---
<section class="h-sec wrap" id="two-ways" aria-labelledby="h-modes-title">
  <h2 id="h-modes-title">In the channel, or in the Activity.</h2>
  <p class="h-intro">The same list, two ways to work on it.</p>
  <div class="h-modes">
    <div class="h-mode">
      <span class="h-mode-ic h-mode-ic--channel" aria-hidden="true">#</span>
      <h3>In the channel</h3>
      <p>The list is a message the whole channel sees. Tick tasks from the menu under it and change them with the buttons, without leaving the chat.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="h-mode h-mode--act">
      <span class="h-mode-ic h-mode-ic--act" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/activity.png" alt="" /></span>
      <h3>In the Activity <span class="h-new">New in 2.0</span></h3>
      <p>One button opens the list in a window inside Discord, on desktop and on mobile. Everyone inside sees every change as it happens. When the last one leaves, the list goes back to the channel with a summary.</p>
      <a class="h-link" href="/docs/activity/">How the Activity works</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
